#{[17592186436383 #edb/ref 1080 "$(1,0)$ and $(1,-1)$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436383 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436383 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "8166063a-dc78-5f3f-8bf7-0c141a4e8d61" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436384 #edb/ref 1080 "images/72/7215170dcbc618f7a006cc4aedd65bdc36dd8bccd708bbe9784dcbfc4974efea.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436384 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436384 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "816f6705-f146-5bfb-a96a-c00de5846b39" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436385 #edb/ref 1080 "images/3b/3b06791c21bcb41f654c1d01f8e4b9cb58df36cf76615ce0b41a0245835c38d5.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436385 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436385 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "8ba99d86-24e8-5ca6-94cd-b5ea2ff49d0e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436386 #edb/ref 1080 "$(1,-1)$ and $(1,0)$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436386 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436386 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "96d545bf-0741-5454-b677-38f6a4355e5f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436387 #edb/ref 1080 "images/cc/ccd7576940650b3c1ba7a0b0c404b2dc39d287261d77f556f63b8166496c69df.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436387 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436387 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "afc4090a-a50d-5cfd-b9cf-41e1abf26da6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436388 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186436378 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436388 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186436381 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436388 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186436384 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436388 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186436385 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436388 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186436387 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436388 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436388 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436388 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186436387 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436388 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "d96343de-f671-5ac9-bcd5-9b8c7a8dc39b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436389 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186436388 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436389 #edb/ref 1069 "q-160631" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436389 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436389 #edb/ref 1071 "![](images/5f/5f91cc8b30f9b764021cd84c374a328c7ffb1287a9f0dc6a211a3fadfac2fdbd.png)\n\nConsider the square region $Δ$ in the $uv$-plane, given by\n\n$$\nΔ=\\{(u,v)\\,:\\,0\\le u\\le 1,\\,0\\le v\\le 1\\}\n$$\n\nand the transformation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT:(u,v)\\to (x(u,v),y(u,v)),\n$$\n\nwhere \n\n$$\nx=u+v,\\,y=-{v}^{2}.\n$$\n\nFind the image of $Δ$ under the action of $T.$ \n\n*Hint: You may assume that $T$ has no critical points in the interior of $Δ.$*" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436389 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "015f5e64-8ccf-5a6a-8fbf-8ce2c8d20eda" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436389 #edb/ref 1074 "We're told that $T$ has no critical points in the interior of $Δ.$ So, to map the entire region $Δ$ onto the $xy$-plane, we transform each side of $Δ$ separately:\n\n- Consider the image of the side ${S}_{1},$ where we have $v=0$ and $0\\le u\\le 1.$ Substituting $v=0$ into our transformation equations, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x,y) & =T(u,v) &  \\\\  & =(u+v,\\,-{v}^{2}) &  \\\\  & =(u+0,\\,-{0}^{2}) &  \\\\  & =(u,\\,0), & 0\\le u\\le 1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is a horizontal line segment traversed from the point $(0,0)$ to the point $(1,0)$ in the $xy$-plane.\n\n- Consider the image of the side ${S}_{2}.$ Here, we have $u=1$ and $0\\le v\\le 1.$ Substituting $u=1$ into our transformation equations, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x,y) & =T(u,v) &  \\\\  & =(u+v,\\,-{v}^{2}) &  \\\\  & =(1+v,\\,-{v}^{2}), & 0\\le v\\le 1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is a downward-opening parabola traversed from the point $(1,0)$ to the point $(2,-1)$ in the $xy$-plane.\n\n- Consider the image of the side ${S}_{3}.$ Here, we have $v=1$ and $1\\ge u\\ge 0.$ Substituting $v=1$ into our transformation equations, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x,y) & =T(u,v) &  \\\\  & =(u+v,\\,-{v}^{2}) &  \\\\  & =(u+1,\\,-{1}^{2}) &  \\\\  & =(u+1,\\,-1), & 1\\ge u\\ge 0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is a horizontal line segment traversed from the point $(2,-1)$ to the point $(1,-1)$ in the $xy$-plane.\n\n- Consider the image of the side ${S}_{4}.$ Here, we have $u=0$ and $1\\ge v\\ge 0.$ Substituting $u=0$ into our transformation equations, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x,y) & =T(u,v) &  \\\\  & =(u+v,\\,-{v}^{2}) &  \\\\  & =(0+v,\\,-{v}^{2}) &  \\\\  & =(v,\\,-{v}^{2}), & 1\\ge v\\ge 0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \nThis is a downward-opening parabola traversed from the point $(1,-1)$ to the point $(0,0)$ in the $xy$-plane.\n\nDrawing the images of the sides of our square, we obtain the following image of $Δ:$\n\n![](images/cc/ccd7576940650b3c1ba7a0b0c404b2dc39d287261d77f556f63b8166496c69df.png)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436390 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186436391 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436390 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "01e6ff8f-00df-5949-ac6e-0410dc19e1c8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436390 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186436389 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436391 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186436393 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436391 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "1a287a6a-b990-525b-8eed-0161adc076ba" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436391 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186373902 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436392 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186436394 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436392 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "8a728ed1-bdb3-5d79-95ad-38502010151b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436392 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186157614 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436393 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "c2c63c2f-25ab-55d2-98c6-3bc6cfeeba08" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186436393 #edb/ref 1063 #edb